  <item>
    <title>18 MBTI or 盖洛普：谁能帮我更加了解我自己？？？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657f138a20d779b49d936508</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657f138a20d779b49d936508</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Dec 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天Lisa和迷糊姐大胆公开了自己的MBTI和盖洛普优势报告，来谈谈报告背后有哪些符合刻版印象的地方和不同之处。如果你也对这两个测评感兴趣，欢迎来和我们一起交流、讨论~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#你将听到以下内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> MBTI是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> 内向与外向 (I or E)：真实的自我和外在的能量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">08:27</a> 直觉与现实 (N or S)：一个容易被外界能量扰动，一个过于关注具体事物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a> 逻辑与感受 (T or F)：理性与感性的平衡之道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> 计划与展望 (J or P)：互相给对方一点小震撼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 盖洛普和MBTI有什么不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 盖洛普优势测评介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2507">41:47</a> 如何通过盖洛普报告更好地理解自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> 更了解自己之后，就更难被外界的评价干扰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3182">53:02</a> 优势与劣势是一体两面的，意识到无法消除负面影响的时候才能更加接受自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3298">54:58</a> 从需要权威指导到自己找到答案，创造属于自己的道路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3742">01:02:22</a> 了解人和人之间的不同，对他人也会更加包容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3905">01:05:05</a> 用发展的眼光看待自己，这些办法也能让劣势变优势！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4248">01:10:48</a> 这些方法，也能帮助你更好地认识自己</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#联系我们</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信号：mihujie321，备注 "听友群"</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：了不起的Amber</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lotsaNm4EuqMPvgtI27UjIf00K95.m4a" length="136541847" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtoCivwczxwpqLgmjMljhYT44W1g.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
