  <item>
    <title>15 （下）除了妻子和妈妈，我更想做好我自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64fdcca36884ccbb198b3bf6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64fdcca36884ccbb198b3bf6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Sep 2023 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>#婚后的变化：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>正面影响：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>在亲密关系中更好的觉察自己，修补曾经的遗憾和创伤</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>内心更安定，焦虑感减轻</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>二十岁时充满无限可能，但也带来更多迷茫</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>三十岁人生的可能性变少，但坚定的选择一条路走下去也很好</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>如何识别一个好的伴侣？外界评价vs自己感受：让别人羡慕不如自己舒服</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>反面影响：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>社交变少，更宅更不自由</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>两个人要互相迁就生活习惯，两个人都觉得在为对方妥协</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>逐渐摸索出生活的界限，和彼此独立的空间</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>一些迷思：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>结了婚还是独立女性吗？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>一定需要外界认同自己是独立女性吗？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>婚后生活不再精致，到底是让渡了生活的主动权，还是回归了生活的本质？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>刚生孩子那几年生活注定陷入混乱，算不算母职惩罚？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>社会传统观念对女性的束缚，所有女性都需要保持警惕</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>当代女性还愿意做一个甘于牺牲奉献的妈妈吗？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>做70分的妈妈，100分的自己</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>#结语：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>单身可以幸福，结婚可以幸福，离婚也可以幸福！</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>#联系我们</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信号：mihujie321，备注 "听友群"</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：了不起的Amber</span></p>]]></description>
